                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dawson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Para phrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Dawson reports that under certain contingencies the President of the
                    Dominican Republic will renew the request that the financial agent take charge
                    of the four ports.)</p>
            </div>
